OL,3,GNEWSAPrime Minister swaps dispatch box
OL,4,Afor Gogglebox
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is to star
OL,7,Fin a special edition of Gogglebox to
OL,8,Fraise funds for Stand Up 2 Cancer.
OL,10,FHe will join Merseyside Mayor Steve
OL,11,FRotheram on the sofa as the pair give
OL,12,Ftheir verdict on a pick of the week's
OL,13,FTV, from reality shows to quizzes.
OL,15,FRotheram said that as well as being a
OL,16,Fhuge supporter of the cause, he had
OL,17,Fagreed to take part because he did not
OL,18,Fwant Burnham to end up looking like
OL,19,F"Billy No-Mates" sitting on the Downing
OL,20,FStreet sofa alone.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
